    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72778" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀκριό-εις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄκρις</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>having many points</i> or
				<i>roughnesses, rugged, jagged,</i> of unhewn stone, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερμάδιον, λίθος, μάρμαρος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.518
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.327
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.380
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.735
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερμάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					300
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					283
				</span></i>
